      "@id": "https://github.com/shimo4228/existence-proof",
      "@type": ["EcosystemRepo", "CreativeWork"],
      "name": "existence-proof",
      "description": "Pre-line complement beside the Authorship Strategy ecosystem — reuses the same infrastructure pattern (llms.txt / knowledge graph / DOI / distinctive terminology) with a different payload and beneficiary: an empowerment doctrine for people producing verifiable, institution-grade artifacts without degrees, affiliations, or professional credentials. Supplies the Existence Proof Format, a feasibility-question corpus with anchored answers, and a published gatekeeping eval. Deliberately carries no extends edge: it operationalizes no Layer 4 tactic and is not a sibling practice line (pre-line status). Japanese is the canonical language.",
      "url": "https://github.com/shimo4228/existence-proof",
