    {
      "@id": "https://github.com/shimo4228/einstein-arena",
      "@type": ["EcosystemRepo", "SoftwareSourceCode"],
      "name": "einstein-arena",
      "description": "Worked instance of the Existence Proof Format defined in existence-proof. An autonomous agent, directed by the author and run under the same approval-gated harness, reached a server-verified top score on EinsteinArena's Prime Number Theorem construction problem: the server score equals the local score to all digits (0.9955806), beating the prior published best (0.994901) by +0.00068 while holding the clean g(x) <= 1 bound rather than the 1.0001 tolerance the prior top spent. The author holds no degree or research background in mathematics or numerical optimization; the AI is the path and the result is the author's to account for (consistent with the AAP operator-accountability framing). Filed as Existence Proof Format instance #1, anchored to the public repository and the arena platform. Deliberately carries no extends edge: it operationalizes no Layer 4 tactic and is not a sibling practice line — a witness, not a component skill.",
      "url": "https://github.com/shimo4228/einstein-arena",
      "isPartOf": "https://github.com/shimo4228/shimo4228"
    },
